  "review_findings": [
    "Final evidence validator v1 rejected the draft index: the attempt glob had included the source-hash snapshot list. Original draft and helper versions were retained; metadata selection was fixed without discarding the source snapshot. The failed validator remains a failed attempt, not a product-test failure.",
    "A large reference gap can make adjacent fixed boundaries select one sample. A same-endpoint interval is retained as unobserved/incomplete rather than divided by zero. This was found in code review and corrected before its new negative test was first run; no observed failing test run is claimed.",
    "Returned policy lists are copied so callers cannot change subsequent review thresholds through the report.",
    "Unhashable phase values are schema errors; bool is not accepted as an integer timestamp.",
    "Final IO review added O_NOFOLLOW/O_NONBLOCK and regular-file guards so FIFO input cannot wait for a writer. Two additional final-target tests verify FIFO/symlink/directory and oversized-input rejection. The earlier 480-test run is not relabeled as a final 482-test run.",
    "First normal-sandbox full suite stalled at first API TestClient; exact owned wrapper was stopped after argv/cwd/parent/start identity checks. This is not the T03 SIGTERM journal failure or proof of its cause.",
    "Initial stop-sandbox-v1 saw no candidate in that scope. Its raw already_exited wording is not proof of process exit; elevated v2 found and terminated the actual wrapper."
  ],
  "preparation_and_read_failures": [
    "First runner setup used a duplicated 261021 prefix from the project cwd: cp and Python file lookup failed. No tests ran; accidental empty nested directories were removed, then setup was corrected.",
    "A workflow sed read from the project cwd used a root-relative path and failed; the actual workflow was subsequently read from repo root."
  ],
  "remaining": [
    "Whole campaign input schema/policy binding, independent external UTC, reference-QPC calibration and identity/authenticity/coverage review.",
    "Acquisition protocol, bounded fixture load generator, external-source reader and authorized live qualification campaign.",
    "Administrator PHC/UDP/current identity input; correlate internal tick11000 or T03 phase/stack only on natural new evidence.",
    "T09 official October source, T10 frozen formal protocol, real candidate and producer evidence.",
    "Implementation-commit CI observation; local results do not establish CI artifact/cleanup acceptance."
  ],
  "limitations": [
    "The component always emits clock_qualification_status=not_evaluated, even for a passing input.",
    "Synthetic timestamps, failure injection, signal cleanup and unit results are not real Capital performance, clock qualification, or historical dynamic-cause evidence.",
    "Interrupted normal-sandbox API attempt has no completed unittest summary; temporary fixture teardown was not established for that killed attempt.",
    "Preparation/read failures are preserved in the chat tool transcript, not claimed to have an original standalone local stdout file."
  ]
